{"id":"wb-6-541","name":"新河闸桥群","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"新河闸桥群","text":"新河闸桥群位于浙江省温岭市。新河闸桥群始建于宋代，现存中闸、麻糍闸、北闸、下卢闸等四座闸桥，其中麻糍闸风格古朴，约为宋元时期遗构，其它几座可能是明清时修建。2006年5月25日，列入第六批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%96%B0%E6%B2%B3%E9%97%B8%E6%A1%A5%E7%BE%A4","revisionId":92245148,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=92245148","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与所在地一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/ab6c16fc1ddf05128bcc07f2.jpg","title":"Xinhe_Lock_Bridges,_2022-02-14.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Xinhe_Lock_Bridges,_2022-02-14.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/bc/Xinhe_Lock_Bridges%2C_2022-02-14.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Siyuwj","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​新河闸桥群。上排：北闸、中闸，下排：麻糍闸、下卢闸由   拼合","width":320,"height":214}}